{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_01T3ux8eFTfVzf2nFK6bXZnA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Anchor R&D Surface v5 â€” \"Durable Work\" â€” Planning Trio Summary\n\n**Grounded bullet claims** (sourced from the three member docs: Master Plan, Implementation Plan, Execution Log, all locked/dated 2026-06-14).\n\n## Goal & North Star\n- The objective is to make every R&D session and idea a **durable, resumable, well-summarized unit of work** â€” closing a session never loses it; a separate deliberate action kills it (MASTER-PLAN Â§North Star).\n- v5 builds on the merged v4.1 \"Project Cockpit\" (tile board â†’ inline panels, engine toggle, grass board, deliverable launch-by-type, Option B branding) plus the shipped terminal fixes; it adds durability, not new modules â€” it **extends existing seams** (IMPL-PLAN conventions).\n\n## Locked decisions (Stage 0/1 user gates)\n- **Run lifecycle = close-to-tile vs. deliberate kill:** the panel's `Ã—` closes the panel but keeps the session as a reopenable tile; a separate, visually distinct hard-KILL control (confirm-gated) reaps PTY + worktree and drops the tile.\n- **Past-session view = real summary + continue-live:** opening a done session shows skill invoked / prompts asked / actions produced (via the validated `summarizer` seam), with a \"Continue in a live session\" button that seeds a new session via `start_session(seed_context=â€¦)`; the original record is never mutated (Risk R2).\n- **Better project summaries:** `summarize_project` gets a stronger seed + a prompt yielding a 1â€“2 sentence objective/purpose, grounding-filtered, cached; the dashboard row + header read cache only (no synchronous model call on render).\n- **Deliverable per Foreman build:** each build resolves a deliverable from explicit signals only; backfill scans existing builds; honest \"no deliverable pinned yet\" when none â€” never fabricated (Risk R4).\n- **Grass Catcher = B+C hybrid workbench** (per approved mockup): filter-tab row (All/raw/refined/promoted + search) over a two-pane workbench; ideas carry stable `grass-<hash>` ids and a rawâ†’refinedâ†’promoted status; refinements are versioned (`grass-<id>/dev-N`) and pullable; project-scoped.\n- **Verification standard (non-negotiable):** every UI wave's \"done\" = rendered-DOM assertions (positive + negative) + a real Playwright/Chromium interaction test + an orchestrator screenshot vs the mockup + user sign-off; a string-grep gate is an automatic HALT (the explicit v4 lesson).\n\n## Build outcome (Execution Log) â€” claimed\n- **All 6 waves GREEN; final suite 716 passed, 1 skipped; distro scan clean** (119 files, only the declared `pywinpty` exception). Each wave committed scoped (W1 `dd08c6b` â†’ W6 `862e249`).\n- The adversarial review caught **real false-greens, not cosmetic ones** â€” these are the most load-bearing claims:\n  - **W1 BLOCKER:** a hard-killed session reappeared in the live bar ~400ms after kill because `repopulate()` re-synced terminal-status sessions; the Playwright test raced past the `setTimeout(repopulate,400)` (the \"v4 timing-blind-gate trap\"). Fixed by excluding terminal statuses + waiting 900ms in the assertion.\n  - **W4 2 BLOCKERS:** resolution used a **project-scoped** doc-role signal, so every build panel claimed the same artifact (R4 fabrication), and the test *encoded the bug* with zero multi-build coverage. Fixed by rewriting resolution session-scoped + a multi-build regression lock.\n  - **W5 BLOCKER:** `grass_save_refinement` had backend tests but **no JS caller** â€” the developâ†’save loop was unreachable, masked by a Playwright test that pre-fabricated the refinement. Fixed by wiring a \"Save refinement\" control and asserting `dev-2` appears *as a result*.\n- W2, W3, W6 reached SHIP with only MINORs (e.g. W6 `rnd grass` cp1252 UnicodeEncodeError on em-dash titles â†’ fixed via UTF-8 stdout reconfigure).\n- **W3 folded in an unplanned mid-build user request** â€” \"project-window changes should reflect on the dashboard timely\" â€” via read-only `GET /api/rnd/projects_html` + an in-place poll/visibilitychange refresh.\n\n## Caveat on \"done\"\n- The log marks **PROJECT DONE on branch `foreman/rnd-surface-v5`**, but explicitly lists one **remaining human/orchestrator gate**: preview-from-branch screenshots + **user sign-off before the `--no-ff` merge to master**. (Note: the CLAUDE.md in context already describes v5 as merged via the top `master` merge commit `32c5a83`, so the sign-off/merge appears to have since happened â€” but the Execution Log itself stops at \"remaining: user sign-off.\")\n\nWant this written to a memory file, or is the summary itself the deliverable?"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":638,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17119,"cache_read_input_tokens":55233,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17119},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"9f0f0cb9-60a0-484b-896f-92ece53a4401","uuid":"6ca747db-d284-43e0-8a9d-07aaf4526c11","request_id":"req_011Cc3uCRdurrHct1mA8oSNM"}
